    "handle": "good-bait-respect-190f",
    "title": "Good Bait Respect 190F",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Respect 190F is a slim-profile floating minnow designed for series saltwater anglers targeting powerful predators.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Despite its compact 190mm body, it is engineered to handle heavy-duty tackle setups up to PE8 while maintaining a tight and responsive swimming action.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Built with a reinforced 1.8mm trough-wire construction and capable of supporting #3/0 treble hooks, the Respect 190F is made to confidently fight large pelagic species in demanding conditions.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Its tight rolling action and stable swimming performance make it highly effective during slow retrieves, especially around rocky shorelines, reef structures and surface feeding zones.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Built for anglers chasing unforgettable fish in wild saltwater environments.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Length 190 mm </p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr. 73</p></li></ul>",
